  "description": "This package provides central modelling components for agent-based simulation.\n            It contains agent environments with update spatial indexing structures for agents\n            and graphs as well as GIS layer to process vector files (*.geojson, *.shp, *.kml, *.gml)\n            and raster files (*.geotiff, *tiff, *.asc).\n\n            For more details how to use MARS, please use the documentation:\n            https://www.mars-group.org/docs/tutorial/intro",
